"Check this if you once checked 'do not show the scanner selection on "
"startup',\n"
"but you want to see it again."
msgstr ""
"Sinale esta opción se escolleu previamente «non mostrar a escolla de escáner "
"no inicio»,\n"
"pero desexa volvelo ver."

#: kookapref.cpp:354
msgid "Load the last image into the viewer on startup"
msgstr "Cargar a última imaxe no visor ao comezo"

#: kookapref.cpp:357
msgid ""
"Check this if you want Kooka to load the last selected image into the viewer "
"on startup.\n"
"If your images are large, that might slow down Kooka's start."
msgstr ""
"Sinale esta opción se quere que Kooka cargue no visor ao iniciarse a última "
"imaxe escollida.\n"
"Se as imaxes son grandes, Kooka podería iniciar máis lento."

#: kookapref.cpp:374
msgid "Image Saving"
